   54     | EXPR OP_AND EXPR
   55     | EXPR OP_OR EXPR
   56     | OP_RESTA EXPR
   57     | OP_NEG EXPR
   58     | PAR_IZQ EXPR PAR_DER

   59 LITERAL: CTE_ENTERA
   60        | CTE_LOGICA
   61        | CTE_FLOAT


